From 13f163516f9affc0efe4a225d127bf49bae95cd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: User <user@example.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:43:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] chore(security): P3 hardening batch and tests lint
 coverage

- config.json writes now 0600 with permission repair on load (server and
  Electron paths); Electron save-config whitelists keys to the server
  configSchema instead of persisting the renderer payload verbatim
- packaged app menu no longer exposes DevTools (non-mac); webPreferences
  pin sandbox/webSecurity explicitly; startup.log redacts credential-shaped
  strings (sk- keys, bearer tokens, JWTs)
- self-host the Google Fonts (public/fonts + src/fonts.css, latin subsets):
  zero third-party requests, works offline, CSP no longer silently breaks
  the intended typography
- include tests/ in eslint (no-explicit-any exempt for fixture shaping);
  fix the surfaced dead imports, unused vars, regex escapes, and one
  prefer-const; repair corrupted native deps (lightningcss/oxide/rollup)
